4. **Is Barbosa da Cunha still on bond?** **Unknown.** The [April opinion](/Volumes/4/GitHub/the-catch-site-wt-detention/data/sources/immigration-detention/ca2-cunha-opinion-2026-04-28.txt) says an immigration judge “released him on bond.” No checked later record establishes his current custody status. This bears on **answer 2**. The page reports the historical release and does not state current status as an unknown; do not turn that absence into a custody claim.

